{"id":"5642","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5642_main_invading-altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus-undulatus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这是侵入天空的高积云薄（透光云类）云片（成层云种）的典型实例，其融合云素的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">长卷轴（波状云类）</span>正融合成<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">厚层上风向</span>。</p>\n<p>透过这些小<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">间隙（漏隙云类）</span>，可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">厚卷云块（密云种）</span>。</p>\n<p>附近的高空探测确认高积云5500米（18000英尺）相对高的云底。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Tze Ching Ho","location":"中国，辽宁，本溪","latitude":"纬度: 41° 29' 32'' N","longitude":"经度: 123° 41' 23'' E","date":"29 September 2015 1635 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 5, CH= 2","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.11","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.11"},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5642_upper_invading-altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus-undulatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>探测是2.5小时后在北西北方向41公里处进行的。从516 - 416 hPa（5551 – 7170米）为98 %RH，从333 - 295 hPa（8785 – 9635米）为高湿度。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4735_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-undulatus-translucidus-perlucidus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>这层高积云（云种为成层状）显然是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">半透明的（透明云类）</span>，而<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">各元素之间的间隙可以看到天空（漏光云类）(2)</span>。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">细长的元素几乎彼此平行，表示其为波纹云类(4)</span>。这层云正在覆盖天空。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Albert Reynolds","location":"南非罗伯逊","latitude":"纬度: 33° 47' 44'' S","longitude":"经度: 19° 52' 2'' E","date":"22 May 2014 1412 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 5, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.4.11","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.4.11"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5172_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus-undulatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>这层中云是高积云。其<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">圆形云团和卷轴</span>视宽为1°-5°，有一些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">阴影</span>。该高积云的具体云种可列为层状云，因为云的天空覆盖范围大。云片很透光，可显露出<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">太阳的位置</span>，因此它也是透光云类。在某些地方，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云素之间有空隙</span>，这也表明是漏隙云类，而<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">长且大致平行的卷轴</span>表明也适用波状云类。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© George Anderson","location":"英国，英格兰，沃金厄姆","latitude":"纬度: 51° 25' 36'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 49' 26'' W","date":"31 August 2014 0850 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.7","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.7"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5193_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-undulatus-perlucidus-from-the-air_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>图为在意大利阿尔卑斯山上空约11000米高空的飞机上看到的一层<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">漏隙波状成层高积云</span>。在图片右下方，可看到山脉上空有一些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© George Anderson","location":"意大利，特伦托省","latitude":"纬度: 45° 45' 17'' N","longitude":"经度: 10° 52' 13'' E","date":"02 September 2013 1749 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.20.4.11","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.20.4.11"}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4531_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-perlucidus-undulatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>云层主要由相当大的云卷组成（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span> - <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span> - <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>），这些云卷大致呈直线状且相互平行。云卷之间可见晴朗天空（属透光云变种）。云层正逐渐布满天空。照片拍摄于极地海洋气团中，地点位于冷锋和锢囚锋之间，两者均具有雷暴特征。</p></div>","copyright":"© A. Viaut","location":"Saint-Palais-sur-Mer, France","latitude":"纬度: 45° 38' 34'' N","longitude":"经度: 1° 5' 9'' W","date":"22 July 1950 1108 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 5, CH= 0","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}